=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {p:Zauko (A)} at (K-9) near Conflux #5.
* Then interact with the **Coal Casket** behind him for a {@k} {k:Torch coal}.
* Walk to the second encampment near Conflux #6 and place the coal into the **Coal Casket** next to the flames.
** The Torch coal is destroyed when you use a conflux, so you must walk to each encampment.
* Afterwards, walk to the third encampment near Conflux #7 and place the coal into the **Coal Casket** next to the flames.
* You may then use Conflux #7 to warp back to Conflux #5 to get back to {p:Zauko (A)} for your reward.
** If you accidentally skip a Coal Casket and your {k:Torch coal} is destroyed, all you have to do is acquire it again then return to the missed one. You do not have to do both with the same coal.

__Zoning **is** required to repeat this quest.__
